00:00:27.616 --> 00:00:30.131
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:00:30.131 --> 00:00:32.714
(upbeat music)

00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:47.039
- Oh my God.

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:49.020
Well, welcome to our
show and congratulations.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:49.950
- Oh my God.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.240
