00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.163
Is that normal?

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:10.746
I guess you feel like
a tool answering that.

00:05:10.746 --> 00:05:11.610
- (laughing)

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.440
- I was like, wait,
that's a weird question.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.192
But I mean, that's amazing impact.

00:05:15.192 --> 00:05:17.280
- You know what, you know, this
was actually my first event,

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:20.073
like in person event since Covid.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.440
So this was kinda like my first time

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.630
like back in the flesh.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.340
- Well, by the way, you're in demand.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.173
Look at that.

00:05:27.173 --> 00:05:29.040
Like, well that's, you're
doing, you're doing it right.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:29.873
- It was amazing.

00:05:29.873 --> 00:05:31.320
It was just amazing being out there

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.050
and like seeing the
readers face to face again

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.450
after so many years and...

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.880
- And you've created this
world, like whichever series,

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.710
you know, they're addicted to or into.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:42.090
Like you've created this whole world

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:43.350
that y'all are all a part of.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.183
That's really cool.

00:05:44.183 --> 00:05:47.940
- Yeah, no, I mean it still
feels like a dream come true.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.820
Like I wanted to be a writer
since I was 16 years old.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.750
- That's amazing.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:52.583
- Yeah, and so to get to do that.

00:05:52.583 --> 00:05:53.760
- What made you wanna, like,

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.574
