reading in the first place?

00:05:56.574 --> 00:05:58.770
- I mean, I was just like a weird kid.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:01.620
I mean I grew up during a
time when like liking fantasy

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:03.630
sci-fi was like not cool.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.400
Like you could get like
thrown in a trash can

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.220
