intellectual readers.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.540
And so I was this like
weird changeling child

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.403
who just appeared and was like,

00:06:16.403 --> 00:06:19.680
'I like fantasy and I like Star Wars.'

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:21.390
