00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.400
and they, you know, let me kind of read

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.993
where my heart wanted to go.

00:06:26.006 --> 00:06:28.080
And by the time I was 12 I knew

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.540
that I loved reading fantasy novels.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.970
And then I just quickly realized I wanted

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.950
