about young women like

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.780
kicking,

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:40.920
I dunno if I can say ass ?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:41.753
Can I say ass?

00:06:41.753 --> 00:06:42.660
- Let's just say it.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.710
Kicking ass , yeah

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:44.543
- Kicking ass.

00:06:44.543 --> 00:06:45.870
And also like the romance.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:49.260
Like I was, I didn't really
like the books I read in school

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.450
because there was never any magic,

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.207
but there was really like
not enough kissing for me.

00:06:54.207 --> 00:06:55.983
(audience laughing)

00:06:55.983 --> 00:06:56.816
- Oh my God.

00:06:56.816 --> 00:06:58.260
Your parents probably had a ball.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:00.720
- My parents had no
idea what I was reading.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.100
- My parents had no idea or my mom

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.210
had no idea what I was listening to.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:04.530
I was like, oh yeah,
I'm totally listening,

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.393
just Michael Louis Smith, mom, that's it.

00:07:06.393 --> 00:07:07.380
- (laughing)

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.903
- Like, which I love by the way.

00:07:08.903 --> 00:07:11.100
- I think it's nice when
like your parents just like,

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.110
they don't hover too much and
they just like let you like

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:14.610
love the things that you're gonna love.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:15.960
- I don't think she let me do that.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.070
She, she didn't know I was listening

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:18.365
to TLC Red Light Special.

00:07:18.365 --> 00:07:19.259
- Really?

00:07:19.259 --> 00:07:20.445
- Yeah, she didn't know.

00:07:20.445 --> 00:07:22.393
- See my parents were just like,

00:07:22.393 --> 00:07:23.532
I don't know.

00:07:23.532 --> 00:07:24.365
They were busy ......

00:07:24.365 --> 00:07:25.680
- I think there's beauty in
that and then letting your,

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.990
like you become who
you're gonna be become.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:32.220
- My five-year-old son, he's
already, the other night

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.530
before we went to the
midnight release party,

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.750
I got all glammed up and I came out

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.610
