(audience laughing)

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.830
- My, what is it with sons?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:49.530
So my son will judge every outfit I wear.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.760
I come down to go out with my girlfriends

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:51.750
and he literally was like,

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:52.933
'Oh, so you're gonna wear that.'

00:07:52.933 --> 00:07:56.466
(audience laughing)
- (laughing)

00:07:56.466 --> 00:07:59.220
- Like, I was styled today
by an actual stylist.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:00.143
- I know.

00:08:00.143 --> 00:08:02.670
- I was like, he saw me sitting
in the chair for two hours

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:03.875
having everything done.

00:08:03.875 --> 00:08:04.708
- This took work

00:08:04.708 --> 00:08:05.541
- And time

00:08:05.541 --> 00:08:08.130
And like, yeah, I don't
know what it's about sons.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.240
They're very honest.

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:10.290
- Oh my god, vicious.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.700
- Meanwhile, my daughter's just like,

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.080
you look fine mom, you look great.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:13.980
And she's like trying to like

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.360
dance on coals to make it better.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.100
- I know, I know but that like....

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.960
- I mean I guess I like that
they're bold and honest,

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.910
but you know, I didn't ask

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.470
- Yeah, I mean, old rat

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.760
I was like, well you know what,

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:27.390
rats are very intelligent so
I take that as a compliment.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.223
- Exactly.

00:08:28.223 --> 00:08:29.520
Turn it around, filter it.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:30.353
I like it.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.790
A house of flame and shadow,

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.700
the third book in her Crescent
City series is out now

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.500
